  },
  "scope": [
    "HAL (classic) as delivered by ST: functions taking the port (the CMSIS device structure GPIOA, stm32n6xx.h) and a GPIO_InitTypeDef configuration (Pin, Mode, Pull, Speed, Alternate); the HAL framework headers stm32n6xx_hal.h / stm32n6xx_hal_def.h and ST's stm32n6xx_hal_conf_template.h configured with the GPIO module only (USE_FULL_ASSERT off, as delivered)",
    "Pin configuration from GPIO_InitTypeDef: input, output push-pull/open-drain, alternate function and analog modes (GPIO_MODER, GPIO_OTYPER), speed (GPIO_OSPEEDR), pull-up/pull-down (GPIO_PUPDR) and alternate function (GPIO_AFRL/GPIO_AFRH) of the selected pins of port A",
    "Pin data: read a pin (GPIO_IDR), write a pin set/reset (GPIO_BSRR / GPIO_BRR), toggle pins, write several pins to set and reset states at once; the configuration lock sequence (GPIO_LCKR, HAL_GPIO_LockPin)",
    "Out of scope: EXTI modes and callbacks (HAL_GPIO_EXTI_*), HAL_GPIO_DeInit (it also resets the pin's EXTI configuration), retime/delay (HAL_GPIO_SetRetime/SetDelay and getters), pin attributes (secure/privilege), other ports"
  ],
  "system_names": [
    "GPIO HAL driver",
    "GPIO driver",
    "STM32N6 GPIO HAL driver"
